# Loaded ONLY by `npm run dev:hosted` (`vite --mode hosted`). Holds no secret
# and is committed on purpose: it is what makes hosted mode a build-time fact
# rather than something a tester has to remember to export — and, just as
# importantly, what keeps it OFF everywhere else. Playwright's `webServer`
# runs the plain `dev` script, so this file is never loaded for the
# milestone-7 suite and local mode stays byte-identical structurally rather
# than by convention.
#
# See `editor/src/lib/backend.ts`'s `isHostedMode` for why the value is
# compared to exactly "1".
VITE_WEBGEN_HOSTED=1
